<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14448" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">distantĭa</span></b> , ae, f.
		disto, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>distance</i>, <i>remoteness.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a longissimis distantiae suae (sc. Veneris)
					finibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 15, 12, § 61</span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a separation</i>,
				<i>opening</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oris hiscens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Acut. 3, 5, 50</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>difference</i>, <i>diversity</i>: inter eos morum studiorumque,
			* <i><span class="en">Cic. Lael. 20, 74</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caloris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 7, 10, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">condicionis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					5, 10, 26</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aetatis vel sexus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 31, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">personarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Deut. 1, 17</span></i>
			.—In plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coloris rufi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					2, 26, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
